  "request": {
    "spec": "Redesign owner identity. The customerCode must become '<REGION>-<HASH8>' where REGION is the region code derived from the postcode and HASH8 is the first 8 upper-case hex characters of SHA-256 over (normalizedTelephone + lastName); drop the sequence numbers entirely. This changes existing behaviour: every value built from the customerCode (the membership number and its check digit), the create audit record, and the locality derivation must all move to the new region-and-hash identity.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nRedesign owner identity. The customerCode must become '<REGION>-<HASH8>' where REGION is the region code derived from the postcode and HASH8 is the first 8 upper-case hex characters of SHA-256 over (normalizedTelephone + lastName); drop the sequence numbers entirely. This changes existing behaviour: every value built from the customerCode (the membership number and its check digit), the create audit record, and the locality derivation must all move to the new region-and-hash identity.\n"
  },
